# Buying boxes puts them on the pile; opening takes them off, one with the ritual, the rest at once.
from rich
view full
tab boxes
click "10"                  # the amount chip on the starter row (the first "10" on screen)
click "buy 10"
expect pile starter 10
shot bought
click "open 1"
key space
wait ritual
click "lovely!"
expect pile starter 9
click "open all"
wait 4
shot opened_all
click "lovely!"
expect pile starter 0
